#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Width"
msgstr "Řezání Gate pro snížení šířky Circuit"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while using **circuit cutting** to reduce the number of qubits in a circuit.  We will cut gates to enable us to reconstruct the expectation value of a four-qubit circuit using only two-qubit experiments.\n"
msgstr "V tomto notebooku projdeme kroky [Qiskit patternu](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) a využijeme **circuit cutting** ke snížení počtu Qubitů v Circuit. Budeme řezat Gate, abychom mohli rekonstruovat očekávanou hodnotu čtyřqubitového Circuit pomocí pouze dvouqubitových experimentů.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Toto jsou kroky, které podnikneme:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Krok 1: Namapování problému na kvantové Circuit a operátory**:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Namapuj hamiltonian na kvantový Circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Krok 2: Optimalizace pro cílový hardware** [_Používá cutting addon_]:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Řezání Circuit a observablu.</font>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpilace subexperimentů pro hardware.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Krok 3: Spuštění na cílovém hardware**:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Spusť subexperimenty získané v Kroku 2 pomocí primitiva `Sampler`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Krok 4: Post-processing výsledků** [_Používá cutting addon_]:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Zkombinuj výsledky Kroku 3 pro rekonstrukci očekávané hodnoty sledovaného observablu.</font>\n"

